title: "autornaR"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Cardoso Garcia
    given-names: Luiz Fernando
    affiliation: Universidade Federal do Paraná
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9616-0927"

abstract: >
  autornaR is an R package designed to streamline RNA-seq data analysis,
  providing tools for data import, validation, normalization, quality
  control, exploratory analysis, differential expression, functional
  enrichment, statistical testing, and visualization. The package aims to
  simplify reproducible transcriptomic workflows while remaining accessible
  to users with limited bioinformatics experience.

keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - transcriptomics
  - bioinformatics
  - differential-expression
  - R

version: "0.2.17"
date-released: 2026-05-27

repository-code: "https://github.com/Luiz-Garcia-R/autornaR"
